{"id":"ENTX-20260727-084746","symbol":"ENTX","side":"long","trade_date":"2026-07-27","entry_time":"08:47:46","exit_time":"08:47:51","entry_price":3.46,"exit_price":3.38,"entry_indicator":"No clean entry trigger was present; the trader chased price at 3.46, which was 0.37 above the VWAP of 3.09 without waiting for a pullback to the EMA9 at 3.26.","exit_indicator":"The exit at 3.38 was a fast stop-out triggered by immediate mean reversion after chasing an extended price.","shares":8,"time_in_trade":"00:05","pnl_before_comm":-0.64,"commission":0.55,"pnl_after_comm":-1.19,"win":false,"verdict":"The trader attempted a breakout entry at 3.46, which is far extended above the VWAP of 3.09 and the EMA9 of 3.26. Entering at 3.46 with a stop suggestion at 2.20 creates an excessively large risk profile of 1.26 per share for a momentum stock. The trade resulted in a quick stop-out at 3.38 just 5 seconds later, indicating poor timing and chasing price action too high without a nearby structural support level. A strict momentum playbook requires entering closer to moving average supports like the EMA9 at 3.26 rather than buying the absolute highs of a candle.","setup_type":"breakout","better_entry":{"price":3.26,"time":"2026-07-27T08:47:40","reason":"Entering at the EMA9 price of 3.26 rather than the chased price of 3.46 provides 0.20 per share of price improvement and reduces initial risk exposure.","how_to_know":"Price pulls back to the EMA9 level at 3.26 and shows a bottoming tail before reclaiming upward momentum."},"better_exit":{"price":3.65,"time":"2026-07-27T08:49:00","reason":"Exiting at a target near 3.65 captures the logical measured move rather than taking a quick stop-out at 3.38 from a chase entry.","how_to_know":"Price reaches the initial 2:1 reward target at 3.68 or shows fading momentum on the MACD histogram of 0.0519."},"suggested_stop":3.15,"suggested_target":3.68,"risk_reward":"1:2","walk_away_rule":"Walk away from any breakout entry where price is more than 10